; ============================================================================
; SELF - bank accounts, credit cards, wallets, reward points, insurance.
; ============================================================================

; ---- Banks & cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:HDFC                  INR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:SBI                   INR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:Cash                  INR
; Transfers whose other half has not been imported yet wait here (see importer.py).
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:Clearing              INR
; Cashback promised but not yet credited.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:Receivable:Cashback   INR

; ---- Wallets (idle balances here are what analytics.py prices at 7% p.a.)
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:Wallet:AmazonPay      INR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:Wallet:Paytm          INR

; ---- Credit cards (7-12 cards: one open line each, plus a [sources.*] block in config)
2020-01-01 open Liabilities:Self:CC:HDFC-Regalia     INR
2020-01-01 open Liabilities:Self:CC:SBI-Cashback     INR
2020-01-01 open Liabilities:Self:CC:ICICI-AmazonPay  INR
; 2020-01-01 open Liabilities:Self:CC:HDFC-Millennia   INR
; 2020-01-01 open Liabilities:Self:CC:Axis-Ace          INR
; 2020-01-01 open Liabilities:Self:CC:SBI-SimplyClick   INR
; 2020-01-01 open Liabilities:Self:CC:ICICI-Coral       INR

; ---- Reward points, each in its own commodity
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:Rewards:HDFC          HDFC_RP
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:Rewards:SBI           SBI_CASHBACK
2020-01-01 open Assets:Self:Rewards:ICICI         ICICI_RP
2020-01-01 open Income:Self:Rewards:HDFC          HDFC_RP
2020-01-01 open Income:Self:Rewards:SBI           SBI_CASHBACK
2020-01-01 open Income:Self:Rewards:ICICI         ICICI_RP

; ---- Income
2020-01-01 open Income:Self:Salary                INR
2020-01-01 open Income:Self:Interest              INR
2020-01-01 open Income:Self:Cashback              INR

; ---- Expenses
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Food:Groceries      INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Food:Dining         INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Housing:Rent        INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Utilities           INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Transport:Fuel      INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Transport:Travel    INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Shopping            INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Insurance:Health    INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Insurance:Term      INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Insurance:Vehicle   INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Fees:Bank           INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Self:Uncategorized       INR

2020-01-01 open Equity:Self:Opening-Balances      INR

; ---- Insurance renewals and other one-off due dates.
; Any directive with `due:` metadata becomes two Google Calendar reminders
; (7 and 2 days before). Card payment due days come from config `due_day`.
;
; 2026-01-15 custom "policy" "Health" "Star Health family floater"
;   due: 2027-01-15
;   premium: 24500
; 2026-03-02 custom "policy" "Term" "HDFC Life Click 2 Protect"
;   due: 2027-03-02
; 2026-06-20 custom "policy" "Vehicle" "Car insurance - KA01 AB 1234"
;   due: 2027-06-20

; ---- Accounts the [[rules]] and the importer can post to
2020-01-01 open Income:Self:Uncategorized              INR

; ---- Transactions appended by the scripts go below this line.
